WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.548
You're ill-prepared!

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:11.553
The lake is not only a poor bulwark,
but it's also a perfect entry point.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:14.055
All right! Head straight in!

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:26.192
What? They're piercing
through our shields at this range?

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:28.319
-They got Olov!
-We're in trouble!

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.904
Askeladd!

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.406
Crossbows, huh?

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.825
Those will cause some fair damage.

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.827
Now's our chance.

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:38.580
Maximum hits before they land!

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:48.006
A child?

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:53.553
What?

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:55.138
The assault stopped?

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.850
Maybe they ran out of arrows.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:03.563
Prepare to land, you bastards!

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:05.231
This is our chance!

